Use the manual capability id for SPV_INTEL_device_barrier

spv::CapabilityDeviceBarrierINTEL (6185) is only on SPIRV-Headers main,
not in any vulkan-sdk release.  Use IGC's CapabilityWithManualId until
the headers catch up.

--- a/IGC/AdaptorOCL/ocl_igc_interface/extensions/SPIRVExtensions.td
+++ b/IGC/AdaptorOCL/ocl_igc_interface/extensions/SPIRVExtensions.td
@@ -516,7 +516,7 @@
 
 def SPV_INTEL_device_barrier : Extension<
   "SPV_INTEL_device_barrier",
-  [ Capability<"DeviceBarrierINTEL"> ],
+  [ CapabilityWithManualId<"DeviceBarrierINTEL", 6185> ],
   "https://github.khronos.org/SPIRV-Registry/extensions/INTEL/SPV_INTEL_device_barrier.html"
 >;
 
